**Methodology:** Each log entry is linked to its predecessor via SHA-256
(SHA-256(prev_hash + canonical_json(payload) + seq + ts)).  Any post-write
mutation, deletion, or reordering of entries is detectable by re-walking
the chain.  This mechanism provides integrity evidence for authorised
security assessments conducted under PurpleForge's ethical guardrails.

